        The companion of the opaque type `S8`, exported with it to the `hypotenuse` package.
    entry .Min   `-128`
    entry .Max   `127`
    entry .underlying   evidence that an `S8` is a `Byte` underneath
    entry .addable   `S8 + S8`, from the `CheckOverflow` policy in scope
